      "番号": 14591272,
      "タイトル": null,
      "本文": "<p>Operator precedence. The ternary operator has the third lowest precedence in C so the addition is evaluated before it could get to the conditional part. Use parentheses:</p> <pre><code>return ([[self obj1] integerValue] == -1 ? 0 : [[self obj1] integerValue]) + ([[self obj2] integerValue] == -1 ? 0 : [[self obj2] integerValue]) + ([[self obj3] integerValue] == -1 ? 0 : [[self obj3] integerValue]); </code></pre>",
